==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep (Enemy Base)|Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep]].
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Enmu]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

